    <entry>
      <title>滑动窗口：左边界为什么不能倒退</title>
      <link href="/posts/0543b8cb.html"/>
      <url>/posts/0543b8cb.html</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p><img src="/assets/skyler/samples/sample-2.webp" alt="文章配图"></p><p><a href="https://leetcode.cn/problems/longest-substring-without-repeating-characters/description/">LeetCode 3 · 无重复字符的最长子串</a> 要求找出连续、没有重复字符的最长片段。“连续”很关键，不能跳着选字符。</p><h2 id="让窗口始终合法">让窗口始终合法</h2><p>用 <code>left</code> 和 <code>right</code> 表示窗口两端，再用字典保存每个字符上一次出现的位置。右边界每次前进一格，遇到窗口内已经出现的字符，就把左边界移到它上次出现位置的后一格。</p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">def</span> <span class="title function_">longest_unique</span>(<span class="params">s: <span class="built_in">str</span></span>) -&gt; <span class="built_in">int</span>:</span><br><span class="line">    last = &#123;&#125;</span><br><span class="line">    left = best = <span class="number">0</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">for</span> right, char <span class="keyword">in</span> <span class="built_in">enumerate</span>(s):</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">if</span> char <span class="keyword">in</span> last:</span><br><span class="line">            left = <span class="built_in">max</span>(left, last[char] + <span class="number">1</span>)</span><br><span class="line">        last[char] = right</span><br><span class="line">        best = <span class="built_in">max</span>(best, right - left + <span class="number">1</span>)</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> best</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="为什么需要-max？">为什么需要 max？</h2><p>看看 <code>abba</code>。读到第二个 b 时，左边界已经移到了位置 2。随后遇到最后一个 a，它上次出现的位置是 0；这个 a 早已在窗口之外，不能把左边界拉回位置 1。</p><p>所以左边界只前进，不倒退。每个字符处理一次，时间复杂度为 O(n)，字典空间为 O(min(n, 字符集大小))。能说清楚窗口保持的条件，就更容易把代码写对。</p>]]></content>
      
      
