    <entry>
      <title>动态规划：从爬楼梯开始</title>
      <link href="/posts/3523c4c2.html"/>
      <url>/posts/3523c4c2.html</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p><img src="/assets/skyler/samples/sample-1.webp" alt="文章配图"></p><p><a href="https://leetcode.cn/problems/climbing-stairs/description/">LeetCode 70 · 爬楼梯</a> 是理解动态规划的一个小起点：一次走一阶或两阶，到第 n 阶有多少种走法？</p><h2 id="先问最后一步">先问最后一步</h2><p>到第 n 阶，最后一步只可能从 n−1 阶走一阶，或者从 n−2 阶走两阶。因此 <code>dp[n] = dp[n-1] + dp[n-2]</code>。这里 <code>dp[i]</code> 表示到第 i 阶的走法数。</p><p>设 <code>dp[0] = 1</code>，表示不走也是一种完成方式；<code>dp[1] = 1</code>。这样就能从小到大推下去。例如到第 3 阶有三种走法：<code>1+1+1</code>、<code>1+2</code>、<code>2+1</code>。</p><h2 id="只保存最近两个答案">只保存最近两个答案</h2><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">def</span> <span class="title function_">climb_stairs</span>(<span class="params">n: <span class="built_in">int</span></span>) -&gt; <span class="built_in">int</span>:</span><br><span class="line">    prev, curr = <span class="number">1</span>, <span class="number">1</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">for</span> _ <span class="keyword">in</span> <span class="built_in">range</span>(<span class="number">2</span>, n + <span class="number">1</span>):</span><br><span class="line">        prev, curr = curr, prev + curr</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> curr</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>题目的 n 至少为 1。代码每次只依赖前两个状态，时间复杂度是 O(n)，额外空间是 O(1)。</p><p>先定义状态，再写转移，最后检查边界。动态规划没有那么玄，它常常只是把“重复想过的事情”认真记下来。</p>]]></content>
      
      
